#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to install the development version of the IBM Quantum Compute client."
msgstr "Dowiedz się, jak zainstalować wersję deweloperską klienta IBM Quantum Compute."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source"
msgstr "Instalacja klienta IBM Quantum Compute ze źródła"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"
msgstr "Instalacja klienta IBM Quantum Compute ze źródła {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` from source, you can access the current development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr "Gdy instalujesz `qiskit-ibm-runtime` ze źródła, możesz uzyskać dostęp do bieżącej wersji deweloperskiej, zamiast korzystać z wersji dostępnej w repozytorium Python Package Index (PyPI). Dzięki temu możesz sprawniej sprawdzać i rozszerzać najnowszą wersję kodu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"
msgstr "Tworzenie i aktywacja nowego środowiska wirtualnego {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr "Przejdź do katalogu projektu i utwórz minimalne środowisko z zainstalowanym tylko Pythonem.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktywuj nowe środowisko.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "Instalacja `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"
msgstr "Wykonaj następujące kroki, aby zainstalować `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` repository.\n"
msgstr "Sklonuj repozytorium `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Przejdź do katalogu `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "Zainstaluj `qiskit-runtime`. Zalecamy używanie [środowiska wirtualnego](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html), aby uniknąć zanieczyszczenia globalnej instalacji Pythona.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Standardowa instalacja**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr "**Tryb edytowalny**: W tym trybie nie musisz ponownie instalować Qiskit po wprowadzeniu zmian w kodzie projektu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ without optimizations.\n"
msgstr "    W trybie edytowalnym skompilowane rozszerzenia są budowane w _trybie debugowania_ bez optymalizacji.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer requirements. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "(Opcjonalnie) Jeśli chcesz uruchamiać testy lub sprawdzenia lintingu, zainstaluj wymagania deweloperskie. Zalecamy używanie [środowiska wirtualnego](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html), aby uniknąć zanieczyszczenia globalnej instalacji Pythona.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Następne kroki {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Zalecenia\">\n"
"  - Przeczytaj [wytyczne dotyczące wkładu](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md), aby wnosić wkład do `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Zainstaluj Qiskit SDK ze źródła](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Uruchom swój pierwszy program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Wypróbuj samouczek, np. [algorytm Grovera](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
